# WS2-08. spec/03 §5 and spec/appendix-stdlib.md §3.1: boxSet drops the old pointee;
# a Box drops its pointee recursively (struct fields in declaration order); a
# Box<T>? drops null-safely. Locals drop in reverse declaration order: o, p, b.
profiles: host
with: tok.clo
expect: output
contrast: tok(5) ==> tok(6)
contrast-expect: output
--- output
drop 1
end
drop 5
drop 3
drop 4
drop 2
--- contrast-output
drop 1
end
drop 6
drop 3
drop 4
drop 2
